{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\n4\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nKiosk Appearance & Content\n\nCustomize this branch's customer kiosk. Menu images, prices, availability and modifiers are managed in Menu & Categories and Customisations & Tax. Receipt content and layout are managed in Receipt & E-Bill.\n\nBranding\n\nThe logo and accent color shown on this kiosk's screens.\n\nRestaurant logo URL\nUpload kiosk logo\n\nPNG, JPEG or WebP, under 2MB.\n\nAccent color\nPreview\nNo logo set\nIdle & Session Timing\n\nWhen an untouched kiosk warns the guest, and how long before it resets to the welcome screen.\n\nIdle warning after (seconds)\n\n5–3600 seconds of no touch before the warning appears.\n\nIdle reset countdown (seconds)\n\n3–120 seconds the warning counts down before the session resets.\n\nChoose backgrounds, preview the welcome screen and edit its message in Kiosk Welcome Screen.\n\nCustomer Screen Wording by Language\n\nEdit welcome, menu, cart, checkout, payment, confirmation and help labels. Empty values use the default wording. Values containing placeholders should retain those placeholders.\n\nCustomer screen \nWelcome & language\nMenu\nCart & checkout\nPayment\nConfirmation\nReceipt\nHelp & assistance\nAll screens\n Show technical keys\nEnglish\nHindi\nGujarati\nMarathi\nTamil\nTelugu\nKannada\nShowing 9 of 228 labels\n0 customized in English\nPrint Receipt\nDigital Delivery & E-Bill Options\nPrint Receipt\nEmail Bill\nQR Invoice\nReceipt\nEnter your email address to receive your official JAMANVAAR tax invoice as a PDF.\nEmail Address\nEmail My Bill\nSave & Publish Kiosk Settings\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
